 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. FINANCE.** A personal cheque register.  Same shape again -* relative file, menu, add / list - but this one* exists to exercise money.** Every amount is COMP-3 packed decimal, and every* amount shown on screen goes through an edited* PICTURE.  Those are the two halves of the system* this program is really testing: the BCD pack* that adds without error, and the PICTURE engine* that makes the result readable.* ENVIRONMENT DIVISION. INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION. FILE-CONTROL.     SELECT REG-FILE ASSIGN TO "REGISTER.DAT"         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC         RELATIVE KEY IS REG-KEY         FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.* DATA DIVISION. FILE SECTION. FD  REG-FILE. 01  REG-REC.     05  RR-DATE         PIC 9(6).     05  RR-PAYEE        PIC X(24).     05  RR-CATEGORY     PIC X(10).     05  RR-KIND         PIC X.         88  RK-DEPOSIT  VALUE "D".         88  RK-PAYMENT  VALUE "P".     05  RR-AMOUNT       PIC S9(6)V99 COMP-3.* WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 01  REG-KEY             PIC 9(4) COMP. 01  FILE-STAT           PIC XX.     88  STAT-OK         VALUE "00". 01  WS-CHOICE           PIC X. 01  WS-DONE             PIC X VALUE "N".     88  ALL-DONE        VALUE "Y". 01  WS-EOF              PIC X VALUE "N".     88  END-OF-FILE     VALUE "Y". 01  WS-LAST             PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0. 01  WS-BALANCE          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0. 01  WS-CAT-TOTAL        PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0. 01  WS-WANTED           PIC X(10). 01  WS-SHOWN            PIC ZZZ9. 01  WS-DATE-OUT         PIC 99/99/99. 01  WS-MONEY            PIC $$$,$$9.99CR. 01  WS-RUNNING          PIC $$,$$$,$$9.99CR.* PROCEDURE DIVISION. MAIN-PARA.     PERFORM OPEN-FILE.     PERFORM COUNT-RECS.     PERFORM UNTIL ALL-DONE         PERFORM SHOW-MENU         PERFORM GET-CHOICE         EVALUATE WS-CHOICE             WHEN "1" PERFORM ADD-ENTRY             WHEN "2" PERFORM LIST-ALL             WHEN "3" PERFORM SHOW-BALANCE             WHEN "4" PERFORM CATEGORY-TOTAL             WHEN "9" MOVE "Y" TO WS-DONE         END-EVALUATE     END-PERFORM.     CLOSE REG-FILE.     STOP RUN.* OPEN-FILE.     OPEN I-O REG-FILE.     IF NOT STAT-OK         OPEN OUTPUT REG-FILE         CLOSE REG-FILE         OPEN I-O REG-FILE     END-IF.* COUNT-RECS.     MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF.     MOVE 0 TO WS-LAST.     MOVE 1 TO REG-KEY.     START REG-FILE KEY NOT LESS THAN REG-KEY         INVALID KEY MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF     END-START.     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE         READ REG-FILE NEXT RECORD             AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF         END-READ         IF NOT END-OF-FILE             MOVE REG-KEY TO WS-LAST         END-IF     END-PERFORM.* SHOW-MENU.     DISPLAY " ".     DISPLAY "CHEQUE REGISTER".     DISPLAY " ".     DISPLAY "1) ADD AN ENTRY".     DISPLAY "2) LIST THE REGISTER".     DISPLAY "3) CURRENT BALANCE".     DISPLAY "4) TOTAL ONE CATEGORY".     DISPLAY "9) QUIT".     DISPLAY " ".* GET-CHOICE.     DISPLAY "CHOICE? ".     ACCEPT WS-CHOICE.* ADD-ENTRY.     MOVE SPACE TO REG-REC.     MOVE 0 TO RR-AMOUNT.     DISPLAY "DATE MMDDYY? ".     ACCEPT RR-DATE.     DISPLAY "PAYEE?       ".     ACCEPT RR-PAYEE.     DISPLAY "CATEGORY?    ".     ACCEPT RR-CATEGORY.     DISPLAY "D=DEPOSIT P=PAYMENT? ".     ACCEPT RR-KIND.     DISPLAY "AMOUNT?      ".     ACCEPT RR-AMOUNT.     ADD 1 TO WS-LAST.     MOVE WS-LAST TO REG-KEY.     WRITE REG-REC         INVALID KEY DISPLAY "COULD NOT WRITE"     END-WRITE.** A payment reduces the balance, a deposit adds to* it.  Nothing here is subtle, which is the point:* the arithmetic is exact because it never leaves* packed decimal. LIST-ALL.     MOVE 0 TO WS-BALANCE.     MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF.     MOVE 1 TO REG-KEY.     START REG-FILE KEY NOT LESS THAN REG-KEY         INVALID KEY MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF     END-START.     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE         READ REG-FILE NEXT RECORD             AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF         END-READ         IF NOT END-OF-FILE             PERFORM POST-ONE             PERFORM SHOW-REC         END-IF     END-PERFORM.* POST-ONE.     IF RK-PAYMENT         SUBTRACT RR-AMOUNT FROM WS-BALANCE     ELSE         ADD RR-AMOUNT TO WS-BALANCE     END-IF.* SHOW-BALANCE.     MOVE 0 TO WS-BALANCE.     MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF.     MOVE 1 TO REG-KEY.     START REG-FILE KEY NOT LESS THAN REG-KEY         INVALID KEY MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF     END-START.     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE         READ REG-FILE NEXT RECORD             AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF         END-READ         IF NOT END-OF-FILE             PERFORM POST-ONE         END-IF     END-PERFORM.     MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-RUNNING.     DISPLAY "BALANCE: " WS-RUNNING.* CATEGORY-TOTAL.     DISPLAY "CATEGORY? ".     ACCEPT WS-WANTED.     MOVE 0 TO WS-CAT-TOTAL.     MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF.     MOVE 1 TO REG-KEY.     START REG-FILE KEY NOT LESS THAN REG-KEY         INVALID KEY MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF     END-START.     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE         READ REG-FILE NEXT RECORD             AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF         END-READ         IF NOT END-OF-FILE AND RR-CATEGORY = WS-WANTED             ADD RR-AMOUNT TO WS-CAT-TOTAL         END-IF     END-PERFORM.     MOVE WS-CAT-TOTAL TO WS-MONEY.     DISPLAY "TOTAL FOR " WS-WANTED ": " WS-MONEY.* SHOW-REC.     MOVE REG-KEY TO WS-SHOWN.     MOVE RR-DATE TO WS-DATE-OUT.     MOVE RR-AMOUNT TO WS-MONEY.     MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-RUNNING.     DISPLAY WS-SHOWN " " WS-DATE-OUT " " RR-PAYEE.     DISPLAY "     " RR-CATEGORY " " WS-MONEY " " WS-RUNNING.